msgid "Sync Provider"
msgstr "Fakahoko Fakataha"

#: src/prefs/prefs.ts:22
msgid "Select the cloud or local service to sync your settings with."
msgstr "Fili 'a e 'ao pe sevisī fakalotofonua ke fakataha mo ho'o ngaahi fokotu'utu'u."

